and category in (&apos;Bakery &amp; Breakfast&apos;,&apos;Baking &amp; Sugar&apos;,&apos;Beauty &amp; Personal Care&apos;,&apos;Beer, Wine &amp; Spirits&apos;,&apos;Beverages&apos;,&apos;Biscuits &amp; Cookies&apos;,&apos;Canned &amp; Dried Goods&apos;,&apos;Chocolates &amp; Sweets&apos;,&apos;Cleaning &amp; Laundry&apos;,&apos;Coffee, Tea, Chocolate &amp; Malt&apos;,&apos;Dairy, Chilled &amp; Eggs&apos;,&apos;Delicatessen&apos;,&apos;Food Pantry&apos;,&apos;Fresh Fruits&apos;,&apos;Fresh Vegetables&apos;,&apos;Health &amp; Wellness&apos;,&apos;Household Essentials&apos;,&apos;Ice Cream &amp; Frozen&apos;,&apos;Meat &amp; Seafood&apos;,&apos;Mother &amp; Baby&apos;,&apos;Party Essentials&apos;,&apos;Pet Needs&apos;,&apos;Ready To Eat&apos;,&apos;Rice, Noodles &amp; Pasta&apos;,&apos;Snacks &amp; Nuts&apos;,&apos;Sports &amp; Nutrition&apos;)
